#. Key: HOWTONOTDIE
msgid "HOW TO NOT DIE"
msgstr ""

#. Key: AGUIDEBY
msgid "A Guide by<br>Scoutmaster Myres"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_PREFACE
msgid "PREFACE"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_PREFACE
msgid ""
"<br>Ahh............................................................................................."
".......................................................................... nature.<br><br>	What "
"greater ecstacy in this life than crunching down on a succulent granola bar while the wind blows "
"across your scalp atop one of this world's many miraculous mountaintops?<br><br>	But of course, "
"nature is not just some fairground amusement, some attraction we might enjoy leisurely from behind "
"glass! Indeed, nature is as dangerous as it is beautiful. And the view is much better from 10,000 "
"feet up than 6 feet under! (Dead)<br><br>	In my 40 years as a Scoutmaster, I've accumulated a "
"variety of rules for surviving dangerous wilderness situations that should help you out in the "
"unlikely event one of your scout outings goes horribly wrong. But of course, all of these rules "
"pale in comparison to the guiding rule of all scoutdom..."
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE0
msgid "NEVER ABANDON A FRIEND IN NEED!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: RULE0SIGNATURE
msgid "-Scoutmaster Myres"
msgstr ""

#. Key: RULE
msgid "RULE"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE1
msgid "KEEP MOVING!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE1
msgid ""
"	First things first: you've gotta get to HIGH GROUND if you wanna be spotted. Nobody ever got "
"rescued off of a mysterious island by loitering around on the beach. So find the nearest peak, and "
"start making your way there."
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE1_1
msgid "	Time is of the essence in the wilderness, so get running towards your destination!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE1_1
msgid "[AIM]LOOK AROUND"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE1_2
msgid "[MOVE]WALK"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE1_3
msgid "[SPRINT]SPRINT"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE1_2
msgid "	See a gap in the trail, or a prickly thorn? Go ahead and JUMP over it!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE1_4
msgid "[JUMP]JUMP"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE1_3
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that jumping while sprinting will tire you out quickly! Take a quick rest if you need "
"to - you won't do anyone any favors by passing out on the mountain!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE2
msgid "KEEP MOVING (UP)!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE2
msgid ""
"	Obviously, you're not going to make it up a mountain without climbing.<br><br>	You can climb "
"almost any surface, so long as you have the stamina!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE2_1
msgid "HOLD[USEPRIMARY]EMPTY-HANDED: GRAB WALL"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE2_2
msgid "[JUMP]IN AIR: GRAB WALL"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE2_3
msgid "[SPRINT]WHILE CLIMBING: LUNGE"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE3
msgid "ALWAYS LEND A HAND!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE3
msgid ""
"	Nothing is more important than sticking together as a team!<br><br>	When your hands are empty, "
"reach out to a friend who's mid-climb and help them reach the next ledge safely!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE3
msgid "[USESECONDARY] EMPTY-HANDED: HELP UP FRIEND"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE3_1
msgid ""
"	You can help from below, too! Crouch down and let a fellow scout stand on your head, then jump to "
"give them a boost!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE3_1
msgid "[CROUCH]CROUCH"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE4
msgid "STAY ALERT, STAY ALIVE!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE4
msgid ""
"	An effective scout keeps an eye on their <color=#0f7f00>Stamina Bar</color> at all times. If it "
"runs out, you'll be temporarily unable to run, jump, and most importantly, climb. <br><br>	Worst "
"case scenario, you could fall off the mountain to your death, which is the worst thing to fall off "
"to!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE5
msgid "LIFE IS PAIN!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE5
msgid ""
"	As you make your way through the untamed wilderness, it's inevitable that you'll get some "
"scratches and bumps.<br><br>	The more hurt you get, the less <color=#0f7f00>Stamina</color> you'll "
"have to run and climb, so tend to your injuries as soon as possible with a bandage or a healing "
"herb!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE6
msgid "STAY HUNGRY"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE6_1
msgid "<BR><SIZE=30>(ACTUALLY, DON'T!)"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE6
msgid ""
"	Getting hurt isn't the only way for your <color=#0f7f00>Stamina</color> to go downhill fast. As "
"you climb, you'll find yourself experiencing <color=#b58200>Hunger</color>, for which 10/10 experts "
"recommend eating food.<br><br>	Be cautious of eating plants from the wilderness! They could poison "
"you and really mess up your day. If you have the option, choose a packaged snack from a corporation "
"you trust!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE7
msgid "DON'T OVERPACK!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE7
msgid ""
"	Putting a backpack on is a great way to carry additional items, which can make the difference "
"between life and death!<br><br>	HOWEVER, the more <color=#61380a>Weight</color> you carry, the less "
"stamina you'll have to climb! An experienced scout knows to pack everything they need... and "
"nothing more!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_RULE8
msgid ""
"	In a survival situation, one of the worst things that can happen is getting separated from the "
"group. <br><br>	Maintain constant communication whenever possible, and point out your next route in "
"advance to avoid leaving a friend behind!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_RULE8
msgid "KEEP AN EYE OUT!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: PROMPT_RULE8
msgid "[PING]:PING LOCATION"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_CONCLUSION
msgid ""
"	Exploring the wilderness is a dangerous activity that can kill you instantly - but so is "
"everything in this world worth doing, like falling in love.<br><br>	Never forget to be a good "
"steward towards our beautiful world, and once again, never forget:"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_CONCLUSION
msgid "IN CONCLUSION"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSPAGE0
msgid ""
"Dear Diary, bad news!!!<br><br>	The ship captain made an oopsy, and we've wound up crashed on this "
"mysterious island! Thankfully, mysterious islands are my specialty.<br><br>	With our whole troop "
"working together, we'll reach the top of the PEAK and signal for help in no time!<br><br>	In the "
"meantime, I'll take this opportunity to add some additional pages to my famous guidebook.<br><br>	"
"<align=right>-Scoutmaster Myres"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BONUSRULE
msgid "BONUS RULE"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE1
msgid "SCAN YOUR SHROOMS!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE1
msgid ""
"	Mushrooms can be a valuable source of nutrition in the wilderness. But watch out!! Some of them "
"can kill you, or even make you poop your pants.<br><br>	There's always a way to tell the poisonous "
"ones apart, though. Here's just one example!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE2
msgid "GATHER 'ROUND THE FIRE!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE2
msgid ""
"	If you find a nice place to light a campfire, make sure to bring your friends close by first! The "
"fire brings something even better than heat and cooked food... and that's motivation!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE3
msgid "EMBRACE THE OCCULT!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE3
msgid ""
"	Wuh woh! One of our scouts stepped on a sea urchin and died!!! I was about to get really sad... "
"but one of the other kids touched a weird statue, and brought their friend back to life!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE3_1
msgid ""
"Seems like this island bends the rules of mortality itself... how wacky! Perhaps something else "
"interesting might happen if we use a statue when everyone is still alive..."
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE4
msgid "HUDDLE UP!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE4
msgid ""
"	As we approach the PEAK, the temperature has begun dropping dramatically. Seeking constant cover "
"is a must, and getting caught out in the open when the wind is strong can be a death sentence."
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE4_1
msgid ""
"	If all else fails, huddling with your friends to share body heat might just save you from an icy "
"grave."
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE5
msgid "I JUST NEED A NAP..."
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE5
msgid ""
"	I saw such a pretty sight... a beautiful moon-shaped fruit, surrounded by fireflies...<br><br>	I "
"feel so relaxed now... maybe a nap wouldn't be so bad..."
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_BONUSRULE?
msgid "WHERE'D EVERYONE GO?"
msgstr ""

#. Key: BODY_BONUSRULE?
msgid ""
"	I had such a wonderful nap, but when I woke up the rest of the troop was gone!<br><br>	I'm sure "
"they're just around the corner. They wouldn't be so foolish as to break <color=red>Rule 0</color> "
"just because I needed a little lie-down!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: TITLE_CRAZY
msgid "RULE 0 RULE 0 RULE 0 RULE 0"
msgstr ""

#. Key: DONTFORGET
msgid "DON'T FORGET<br><size=150%>RULE 0!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: NEVERABANDON
msgid "Never Abandon a Friend in Need!"
msgstr ""

#. Key: WEMADEIT
msgid ""
"We made it!!<br><br>Even without our scoutmaster's help, we managed to get "
"rescued!<br><br>SněžnýPerník managed to make it up first.<br>Zedorfska made it out without a "
"scratch.<br>CaptainBear was injured but in great spirits.<br>Squdel & Kirpich are a little bruised. "
"Good thing they had each other!<br>Ronokopl kept the team fed and safe.<br><br>Mr. Myres, if you're "
"reading this... We couldn't find you!! I'm sorry!"
msgstr ""

